<title>PERU: Repsol to drill at Peru's Salaverry - news agency.</title>
<headline>Repsol to drill at Peru's Salaverry - news agency.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish oil company Repsol SA will drill a first exploratory well in January at its concession in the Salaverry basin near Peru's northern city of Trujillo, state news agency Andina said Monday.</p>
<p>Andina added that Repsol, which has been exploring there since the beginning of this year, planned to drill at least three wells at the site.</p>
<p>&quot;The Spanish company guarantees an investment of $40 million if the results are favorable,&quot; Andina said.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Cawthorne, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
